SUMMARY:COMING OCTOBER 7th | STRFKR w/ Maggie FM
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, October 7 | Amphitheater Stage | 6 PM DOORS | 6:30PM SHOW | From $38.05 Event Details and Tickets \nSince forming in 2007\, STRFKR have been perfecting a style that hides emotional complexities and existential searching in hyper-catchy\, melody-forward pop music. The band’s spiritual and philosophical undercurrents never outshine their highly danceable sounds\, but both are integral parts of what they do. Over the years and through the course of a discography that includes not just multiple studio albums but a wealth of fan-focused auxiliary releases\, STRFKR’s combination of thoughtful lyricism and party starting hooks have made them a consistent success with critical music listeners and show-goers. \n  \nSierra Nevada Brewing Co. is one of America’s premier craft breweries\, highly regarded for using only the finest quality ingredients.  Sierra Nevada has set the standard for craft brewers worldwide with innovations in the brewhouse as well as advances in sustainability. The view from our tree-lined brewery is something special no matter the season. Tour the brewhouse\, feast in the Taproom or soak in the sun on our Back Porch with a beer\, including the legendary Pale Ale and a snack. For our upcoming event line-up click here! \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-october-7th-strfkr-w-happy-sad-face-2-2/
LOCATION:Sierra Nevada Mills River\, 100 Sierra Nevada Way\, Mills River\, NC\, 28732
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music,Mills River
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/746119941_1361181352774796_3964644000701638736_n-e1786642346509.jpg
GEO:35.4308568;-82.5535594
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Sierra Nevada Mills River 100 Sierra Nevada Way Mills River NC 28732;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=100 Sierra Nevada Way:geo:-82.5535594,35.4308568
END:VEVENT
