SUMMARY:Asheville Oktoberfest ft. Lagerhosen
DESCRIPTION:  \nJoin us on Coxe Avenue for an afternoon packed with local craft beverages\, live oompah music with Lagerhosen\, German-inspired eats\, food trucks\, games\, and plenty of Oktoberfest fun.\nThe festival is FREE and open to the public\, so everyone is invited to come out and enjoy the celebration. But if you want to taste your way through Western North Carolina\, you’ll need a Prost Pass! ($25+ adv\, $35+ day of)\nWe’re bringing together 20+ local breweries\, each pouring at least two fall flavors\, plus selections from Western North Carolina distilleries and wineries. From Oktoberfest classics and crisp lagers to seasonal brews and fall-inspired flavors\, there will be plenty to discover.\nYour Prost Pass includes a 21+ wristband\, an 8 oz. commemorative tasting glass\, and a punch card to sample your way through the festival.\nCome dressed in your Oktoberfest best\, test your skills in traditional games\, grab some German food\, raise a glass with friends\, and experience one of Asheville’s favorite fall traditions in its new home on Coxe Avenue in the South Slope Brewery District.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/asheville-oktoberfest-ft-lagerhosen/
LOCATION:Asheville’s South Slope\, 75 Coxe Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
GEO:35.5920902;-82.55537
